            "original_author": "",
            "original_author_id": 0,
            "title": "Forgejo issues I'm interested in working on",
            "body": "## Governance-related\n\n### Joining teams\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/902:\u00a0Allow users to request to join a team (maybe we can [win over a Gogs user](https://github.com/gogs/gogs/issues/8052) with that?) **(proposed a design https://codeberg.org/forgejo/design/issues/65)**\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/14556 don't send invites if the user is already part of the org -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14571\n* show the list of invited users in the list of organization members (not just on the team page)?\n\n### Notifications\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/13945 no notification when added to a team\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/13944 no notification when removed from a team\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/12120 no notification for invites\n\n### Member management\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/12042 the notion of \"role\" in the list of members isn't helpful\n\n### Automation\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/6142: access tokens for orgs\n\n### Org transparency\n\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/862 transparent organizations **(proposed a design https://codeberg.org/forgejo/design/issues/64)**\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/7825 move the membership visibility button to user settings\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/12448 show less avatars on the \"teams\" page\n\n### Private communication\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/design/issues/68 MediaWiki-like private contact form\n\n## Usability issues I run into\n\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/240 behaviour of force-push on PRs\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/559 fork and edit file\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/3502 assigning non-org users\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/14229 make pull requests editable by default\n\n## Other interesting bits\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/6638 public activity feed for an org\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/6751 making a PR from a fork that belongs to an org\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/design/issues/21 magic repos **(proposed a design: https://codeberg.org/forgejo/design/issues/66)**\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/13278 marking a repository as having migrated elsewhere\n* https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/13499 incorrect \"First-time contributor\" badge\n\n## Mentioned by Ludovic as relevant for Guix\n\n* une meilleure reconnaissance de fusions manuelles, par ex. en reconnaissant le trailer Git \u00ab Merges \u00bb : https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/7972\n* la possibilit\u00e9 d\u2019\u00eatre notifi\u00e9 pour des issues qui ont une certaine \u00e9tiquette : https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/11703\n* il y a certaines regexps dans notre CODEOWNERS qui n\u2019ont pas l\u2019effet escompt\u00e9 mais sans qu\u2019on sache pourquoi : https://codeberg.org/guix/guix/issues/451\n\n## Done\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/9330 show the \"Allow edits by maintainers\" setting on PRs -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/9392</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/6185 open a PR between forks -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/9045</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/6186 error reporting for CI workflows with syntax errors</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/7934 testing webhooks doesn't work if push events aren't enabled</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/11036 link to workflow definition on action pages -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/11216</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/1529 add org members from the members page -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/11848</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/12103 pagination for team members -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/12447</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/2325 small versions of avatars -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/11242</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/8951: Inviting a user to an org/team -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/12845</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/12660 link to wrong version of a pipeline -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/12734</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/12716 set org membership visibility on invite page -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/13644</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/13852 visual notification that invitation succeeded -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/13869</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/12570 expiring invitations -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/13630</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/12120 visibility of invites on org page ->  https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/13880</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/12854 make the list of teams visible to all org members -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/13943</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/12102 empty members list for external viewers -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/13977</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/13955: let users decline invitations -> forgejo/forgejo#14175</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/14331 bug when inviting members again -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14352</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/12567 provenance of memberships -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14117</s>\n* <s>https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/issues/12869 API for invitations -> https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/13971</s>",
